    <item>
      <title>Call for papers</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/2026/call/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/2026/call/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;call-for-submissions&#34;&gt;Call for Submissions&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Submissions to QEC26 are done through EasyChair:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The link will be available soon.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Submissions for talks and posters are open until the end of &lt;strong&gt;Friday Feb 27th AOE.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;talk-submission-tracks&#34;&gt;Talk Submission Tracks&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This year, QEC is trialing two submission tracks for talks: Published Work and Rapid Communication.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Published Work track is intended for presenting work from completed technical manuscripts, similar to previous years of submissions to QEC.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
